Back in 2008 at age 62, Dolly Parton released a single proclaiming she was "just a backwoods Barbie, too much makeup, too much hair."
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/57f47062-a0b1-11f1-bfdf-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/b1eafd7dce9336939880e6ee32dd960e7e66b898.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/57f47062-a0b1-11f1-bfdf-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/b1eafd7dce9336939880e6ee32dd960e7e66b898.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">58e35876-a0b1-11f1-9051-87f52546a6be</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 18:18:17 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/57f47062-a0b1-11f1-bfdf-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/b1eafd7dce9336939880e6ee32dd960e7e66b898.jpg">© Robyn Beck / AFP/File</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>'Shocking' book about Putin's private life wins French literary prize</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260825-shocking-book-about-putin-s-private-life-wins-french-literary-prize</link><description>
A taboo-breaking book about Vladimir Putin's rise to power and private life, written by two exiled Russian journalists, won a newly established French literary prize on Tuesday.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1da653fe-8530-11f1-b1cb-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-20T164544Z-2032476191-RC2LHMAO5MSC-RTRMADP-3-RUSSIA-PUTIN.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1da653fe-8530-11f1-b1cb-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-20T164544Z-2032476191-RC2LHMAO5MSC-RTRMADP-3-RUSSIA-PUTIN.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">56adb7b2-a09e-11f1-8d4d-b97a63a72a51</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 16:02:13 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1da653fe-8530-11f1-b1cb-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-20T164544Z-2032476191-RC2LHMAO5MSC-RTRMADP-3-RUSSIA-PUTIN.jpg">via REUTERS - Alexander Kazakov</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>US and Denmark push for nationwide expansion of UN arms embargo in Sudan</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260825-us-and-denmark-push-for-nationwide-expansion-of-un-arms-embargo-in-sudan</link><description>
The United States on Monday urged the United Nations Security Council to expand an arms embargo on the Sudanese region of Darfur to cover all of Sudan, saying the nation's brutal conflict risks regional expansion. The suggestion was supported by Denmark, which holds the Council's rotating presidency. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/09831f54-2d95-11f0-9636-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP25123519167407.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/09831f54-2d95-11f0-9636-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP25123519167407.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d45c51f4-a081-11f1-a5dd-bfda8eb3ae4b</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 15:00:21 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/09831f54-2d95-11f0-9636-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP25123519167407.jpg">© AP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>At least 40 killed as gangs attack displaced people near Haiti capital</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260825-at-least-40-killed-as-gangs-attack-displaced-people-near-haiti-capital</link><description>
At least 40 people have been killed, some execution-style, after gangs attacked displaced people sheltering in a church near Haiti's capital Port-au-Prince at the weekend, local authorities said.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dd5c43a8-a019-11f1-aa1f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236704099772.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dd5c43a8-a019-11f1-aa1f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236704099772.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8485013a-a059-11f1-9823-679e8866c115</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 08:53:49 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dd5c43a8-a019-11f1-aa1f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236704099772.jpg">© AP Photo/Odelyn Joseph</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Namibia paves way for phosphate mining in the Atlantic Ocean</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260825-namibia-paves-way-for-phosphate-mining-in-the-atlantic-ocean</link><description>
Namibia has granted environmental clearance for an offshore phosphate mining project that paves the way for the world's first commercial seabed-dredging operation for the mineral, despite opposition from green groups and the fishing industry.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/51fdb99a-a046-11f1-bb8a-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/ed9e94009377e5e8e0ade5ed52204e6e27aa4874.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/51fdb99a-a046-11f1-bb8a-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/ed9e94009377e5e8e0ade5ed52204e6e27aa4874.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">52cbf148-a046-11f1-bc5f-2b4787bb34a0</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 05:32:11 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/51fdb99a-a046-11f1-bb8a-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/ed9e94009377e5e8e0ade5ed52204e6e27aa4874.jpg">© MARCO LONGARI / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Ukraine's allies pledge to continue support with focus on air defence</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260824-ukraine-s-allies-pledge-to-continue-support-with-focus-on-air-defence</link><description>
Ukraine's allies on Monday pledged to keep up their support in the war against Russia, with a renewed focus on air defence investment to counter a shortage of US Patriot interceptors. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/71afd38c-9fa5-11f1-af79-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236363361580.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/71afd38c-9fa5-11f1-af79-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236363361580.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f9103d0e-9fe5-11f1-8ca1-af870d26e276</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 19:17:39 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/71afd38c-9fa5-11f1-af79-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236363361580.jpg">© Henry Nicholls / Pool AFP via AP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Saudi Arabia to invest €6bn in building theme parks near Paris</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260824-saudi-arabia-to-invest-7-bn-in-theme-parks-near-paris-french-presidency</link><description>
France and Saudi Arabia on Monday signed a memo of understanding for a €6 billion Saudi investment to create three theme parks near Paris, the office of the French president said.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4cc18b4-9fe6-11f1-bfdc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/e5bef9e73595ec0265cbf9aa320acbe08d2c098a.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4cc18b4-9fe6-11f1-bfdc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/e5bef9e73595ec0265cbf9aa320acbe08d2c098a.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c5e83b10-9fe6-11f1-a438-af870d26e276</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 18:08:12 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4cc18b4-9fe6-11f1-bfdc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/e5bef9e73595ec0265cbf9aa320acbe08d2c098a.jpg">© LOU BENOIST / POOL/AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Looking up: Hunting stars and nebulae from the peaks of the French Alps</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260824-looking-up-hunting-stars-and-nebulae-from-the-peaks-of-the-french-alps</link><description>
French astronaut Sophie Adenot made history this month as the first French woman to perform a spacewalk. Back on Earth, space enthusiasts across France are finding their own ways to reach for the stars. In a five-part series this week, RFI meets some of them. First up is astrophotographer Aude Nowak, who climbs high into the French Alps to capture stars, nebulae and the Milky Way.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3f56f28c-9f1c-11f1-834c-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/D-abord-photographe-immobili%C3%A8re-Aude-Nowak-a-petit-%C3%A0-petit-abandonn%C3%A9-les-appartements-pour-les-montagnes-et-les-%C3%A9toiles-Baptiste-Coulon.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3f56f28c-9f1c-11f1-834c-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/D-abord-photographe-immobili%C3%A8re-Aude-Nowak-a-petit-%C3%A0-petit-abandonn%C3%A9-les-appartements-pour-les-montagnes-et-les-%C3%A9toiles-Baptiste-Coulon.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5380e94a-9fc9-11f1-aebf-93e902fb0597</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 15:48:56 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3f56f28c-9f1c-11f1-834c-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/D-abord-photographe-immobili%C3%A8re-Aude-Nowak-a-petit-%C3%A0-petit-abandonn%C3%A9-les-appartements-pour-les-montagnes-et-les-%C3%A9toiles-Baptiste-Coulon.jpg">© Baptiste Coulon / RFI</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Mediterranean migrant rescue ships threatened by Libyan groups, warns NGO</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260824-mediterranean-migrant-rescue-ships-threatened-by-libyan-groups-warns-ngo</link><description>
A leading group monitoring and providing aid to migrants crossing the Mediterranean have warned that its rescue ships have been facing increasing threats and harassment from Libyan groups.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/148ae9a0-8059-11f1-9930-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-92ZB9ZR.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/148ae9a0-8059-11f1-9930-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-92ZB9ZR.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a4727752-9fa5-11f1-a762-d969d98d7dd8</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 12:22:56 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/148ae9a0-8059-11f1-9930-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-92ZB9ZR.jpg">© Sameer al-Doumy/AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>France gathers Ukraine's allies to boost resistance to Russia</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260824-france-gathers-ukraine-s-allies-to-boost-resistance-to-russia</link><description>
Countries allied with Ukraine in its war with Russia are meeting on Monday to reaffirm support for Kyiv and discuss how to pressure Moscow to halt its invasion, in talks held symbolically on Ukraine's independence day. French President Emmanuel Macron will co-chair the gathering of the so-called "Coalition of the Willing" via video link.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c9e866ea-d9d0-11f0-b2eb-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-12-01T174709Z-157097831-RC2A4IAPKHYG-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-DEBT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c9e866ea-d9d0-11f0-b2eb-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-12-01T174709Z-157097831-RC2A4IAPKHYG-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-DEBT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">1e3364ba-9d6d-11f1-925e-6d8c4dce50bf</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 05:02:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c9e866ea-d9d0-11f0-b2eb-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-12-01T174709Z-157097831-RC2A4IAPKHYG-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-DEBT.jpg">© Valentyn Ogirenko / Reuters</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Southern African mothers plead for sons lured to Russia's war in Ukraine</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260823-southern-african-mothers-plead-for-sons-lured-to-russia-s-war</link><description>
Instead of celebrating her son's birthday this month, Zimbabwean mother Rodwin Chitewere spent the day praying for his body to be brought home from Russia, where he was reportedly killed fighting Moscow's war against Ukraine.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3108037c-9b90-11f1-8781-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/4f0ee42d48be3951fcc0a4d769636323e1b83893.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3108037c-9b90-11f1-8781-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/4f0ee42d48be3951fcc0a4d769636323e1b83893.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5a3badee-9bb2-11f1-9818-f5b8caecbf68</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 11:28:37 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3108037c-9b90-11f1-8781-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/4f0ee42d48be3951fcc0a4d769636323e1b83893.jpg">© RAJESH JANTILAL / AFP/File</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>France to send interceptor missiles to Ukraine after Russian strikes</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260822-france-to-send-interceptor-missiles-to-ukraine-after-russian-strikes</link><description>
French President Emmanuel Macron on Saturday announced Paris would deliver new interceptor missiles to Ukraine, with Kyiv's air defences running short after the latest round of deadly Russian attacks.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/8ba90ba6-9d7e-11f1-ad58-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T192414Z-1904355796-RC2H2NACS2W0-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-ATTACK-KYIV.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/8ba90ba6-9d7e-11f1-ad58-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T192414Z-1904355796-RC2H2NACS2W0-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-ATTACK-KYIV.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">7339d4d2-9e2e-11f1-8d94-efa8280ce22b</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:52:51 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/8ba90ba6-9d7e-11f1-ad58-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T192414Z-1904355796-RC2H2NACS2W0-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-ATTACK-KYIV.jpg">© Oleksandr Ratushniak / Reuters</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Diplomats urge France and UK to uphold rule of law in Palestinian territories</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260822-former-envoys-urge-joint-french-uk-action-on-palestinian-territories</link><description>
Dozens of former senior French and UK diplomats on Saturday urged their governments to work together to uphold international law in the Palestinian territories, accusing Israel of seeking to "destroy" any prospect of a viable Palestinian state.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4df126be-9e0e-11f1-ad30-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/85e7dd8c346dba72bef7c91da83b8a5b45173c6d.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4df126be-9e0e-11f1-ad30-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/85e7dd8c346dba72bef7c91da83b8a5b45173c6d.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">4f01b776-9e0e-11f1-b29d-1df8a6684097</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 09:46:11 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4df126be-9e0e-11f1-ad30-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/85e7dd8c346dba72bef7c91da83b8a5b45173c6d.jpg">© Ilia YEFIMOVICH / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International report</category><title>Turkey, Saudi Arabia and Pakistan strengthen ties as Israel tensions rise</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/podcasts/international-report/20260822-turkey-saudi-arabia-and-pakistan-strengthen-ties-as-israel-tensions-rise</link><description>
Tensions between Turkey and Israel have intensified after an Israeli airstrike targeted a Syrian military airbase near the Turkish border. The strike came days after Turkey’s new military pact with Saudi Arabia and Pakistan.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d4b7ad0e-9255-11f1-9f2e-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T111511Z-1176211354-RC2NTMA0W6QT-RTRMADP-3-SAUDI-DEFENCE-AGREEMENT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d4b7ad0e-9255-11f1-9f2e-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T111511Z-1176211354-RC2NTMA0W6QT-RTRMADP-3-SAUDI-DEFENCE-AGREEMENT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">39ae4a06-9d55-11f1-9576-2deea6adc246</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:07:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Dorian Jones</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>More Russians seeking to leave as fears of another mobilisation grow</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260821-mobilisation-fears-fuel-renewed-russian-interest-in-leaving-the-country-relokatz</link><description>
Fears of another military mobilisation are driving an increasing number of Russians to look at exiting the country, an emigration support platform has told RFI, nearly four years after Moscow called up 300,000 reservists to fight in Ukraine.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ef236b40-bc0b-11f0-a79b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-83DB7ZQ.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ef236b40-bc0b-11f0-a79b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-83DB7ZQ.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">1a977f20-9d41-11f1-817b-c93d65df09a9</guid><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 16:03:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ef236b40-bc0b-11f0-a79b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-83DB7ZQ.jpg">© Andrej Isakovic / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>France and European allies press Israel to abandon West Bank settlement plan</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260821-france-and-european-allies-press-israel-to-abandon-west-bank-settlement-plan</link><description>
